# Completion gate

Before saying complete:

1. Re-read acceptance criteria and identify any missed item.
2. Inspect the diff for scope creep and generated files.
3. Run relevant unit/integration/content checks.
4. Run `pnpm check` for a complete logical unit.
5. Run performance fixtures when counts, loops, rendering, snapshots, or assets changed.
6. Review deterministic ordering, RNG, save/replay, and migration effects.
7. Confirm no placeholder/TODO is standing in for required behavior.
8. Update docs/ADR when contracts changed.
9. Report exact command results and remaining risk.
